cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Climate Connectivity Taxonomy, please cite the paper describing it (preferred-citation)."
type: dataset
title: "Climate Connectivity Taxonomy"
version: "1.1"
date-released: "2026-08-27"
abstract: >-
  A SKOS vocabulary connecting dispersed climate change adaptation and disaster
  risk knowledge, driving the data connections in the Climate Connectivity Hub.
  It builds on the IPCC AR6 Glossary and the UNDRR-ISC Hazard Information
  Profiles, extended with expert-reviewed terms from online knowledge platforms.
  This repository mirrors it as a versioned Turtle file and publishes it as a
  browsable website, with the tooling to build and preview it.
